{"timestamp":"2026-03-31T10:05:51Z","event_ts":"2026-03-31T10:05:35Z","repo":"oist/smartphone-robot-android","event_name":"issue_comment","action":"created","actor":"topherbuckley","run_id":"23791834090","run_attempt":"1","sender":{"login":"topherbuckley","html_url":"https://github.com/topherbuckley"},"issue":{"number":33,"title":"Why are right wheel values negated?","state":"closed","html_url":"https://github.com/oist/smartphone-robot-android/issues/33","milestone":null},"pull_request":null,"comment":{"id":4161450416,"html_url":"https://github.com/oist/smartphone-robot-android/issues/33#issuecomment-4161450416","created_at":"2026-03-31T10:05:35Z","updated_at":"2026-03-31T10:05:35Z","body":"Resolved in merged PR #59.\n\nThe right-wheel sign inversion is intentional at the hardware level because the drive layout is mirrored, but subscriber-facing wheel metrics should still use a consistent positive-forward convention on both sides.\n\nThe follow-up fix here was to:\n- clarify that normalization in `WheelData`\n- remove the redundant extra negation and stale TODO in `handsOnApp`\n\nSo this issue is closed as a sign-convention clarification / consumer-facing cleanup rather than a broad motor-control behavior change.\n"},"milestone":null,"changes":null,"severity":"INFO","target_url":"https://github.com/oist/smartphone-robot-android/issues/33#issuecomment-4161450416","event_id":"075fb6b7204a7a8473faf55cf0865494d655d948e4f470877a0e4b9c682456c7"}
{"timestamp":"2026-03-31T10:07:07Z","event_ts":"2026-03-31T10:06:51Z","repo":"oist/smartphone-robot-android","event_name":"issue_comment","action":"created","actor":"topherbuckley","run_id":"23791882765","run_attempt":"1","sender":{"login":"topherbuckley","html_url":"https://github.com/topherbuckley"},"issue":{"number":40,"title":"Long list of deprecated things in YuvToRgbConverter.kt","state":"closed","html_url":"https://github.com/oist/smartphone-robot-android/issues/40","milestone":null},"pull_request":null,"comment":{"id":4161457506,"html_url":"https://github.com/oist/smartphone-robot-android/issues/40#issuecomment-4161457506","created_at":"2026-03-31T10:06:51Z","updated_at":"2026-03-31T10:06:51Z","body":"Resolved in merged PR #59.\n\n`YuvToRgbConverter.kt` was updated to remove the deprecated RenderScript-based conversion path that was producing the long deprecation warning list. That cleanup is why this issue is now closed.\n"},"milestone":null,"changes":null,"severity":"INFO","target_url":"https://github.com/oist/smartphone-robot-android/issues/40#issuecomment-4161457506","event_id":"ce6465a05af4073304a06287baac9e929dc5cb29a167a3ebf1465c9b683419de"}
